WEBVTT

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:31.575
AG: On top of building a microcommunity,

00:18:31.599 --> 00:18:33.747
Luz was doing something
else important here,

00:18:33.771 --> 00:18:36.230
something that directly
affected her loneliness.

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:40.329
There's evidence that helping others
makes us feel less lonely.

00:18:40.353 --> 00:18:42.117
It allows us to feel that we matter,

00:18:42.141 --> 00:18:45.376
that we're noticed
and valued and appreciated.

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:47.957
For Luz, creating a space
for young people of color

00:18:47.981 --> 00:18:49.330
to get a foothold in science

00:18:49.354 --> 00:18:51.733
helped her feel more connected
to people at work.

00:18:51.757 --> 00:18:53.583
Helping others helped her.

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:57.134
By now, she's been running intern
programs at work

00:18:57.158 --> 00:18:58.406
for 15 years.

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:02.066
She's expanded the microcommunity
into an alumni network.